<title>HUNGARY: Quaestor posts H1 net profit of HUF116mln.</title>
<headline>Quaestor posts H1 net profit of HUF116mln.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six-month period ending June 30.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of forints unless stated)</p>
<p>					Jan-June 1997</p>
<p>    Operating profit		  134.3</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit		    143.2</p>
<p>    After-tax profit		  115.6</p>
<p>    Material expenditure		0.5</p>
<p>    Personnel expenditure	     9.1</p>
<p>    Depreciation			 15.4</p>
<p>    Other costs			  18.5</p>
<p>    Other expenditures		  2.7</p>
<p>NOTE - Full company name is  Quaestor Ertekpapir Kereskedelmi es Befektetesi Rt. The figures are audited and were calculated according to the Hungarian accounting standard. Comparative 1996 figures were not available.</p>
<p>Quaestor said in a statement that its pre-tax profit rose by 75.3 million forints from the whole 1996.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327-4040</p>
</text>
